From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:33:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 20/47] dt-bindings: pinctrl: ingenic: Add X2600

The GPIO and pin controller of the Ingenic X2600 follows the X2000 one,
with its ports 0x1000 apart and shadow registers in each port. Document
the compatible strings of the controller and its GPIO ports.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/ingenic,pinctrl.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/ingenic,pinctrl.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/ingenic,pinctrl.yaml
index 84e960255..7ba3bb475 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/ingenic,pinctrl.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pinctrl/ingenic,pinctrl.yaml
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ properties:
           - ingenic,x1830-pinctrl
           - ingenic,x2000-pinctrl
           - ingenic,x2100-pinctrl
+          - ingenic,x2600-pinctrl
       - items:
           - const: ingenic,jz4760b-pinctrl
           - const: ingenic,jz4760-pinctrl
@@ -86,6 +87,7 @@ patternProperties:
           - ingenic,x1830-gpio
           - ingenic,x2000-gpio
           - ingenic,x2100-gpio
+          - ingenic,x2600-gpio
 
       reg:
         items:
